      "cooked": "<p>The OblivAeon episode suggests she definitely keeps the identity close to the vest as even her parents didn’t know she was Wraith.   We did have in episode 140 where Miss Info setup a way that she feel unmasked into the Wretched Hive bar.  However, we haven’t gotten a follow up as to whether any of them recognized her or cared.</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-140-writers-room-mystery-comics-vol-2-issue-476\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-140-writers-room-mystery-comics-vol-2-issue-476\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-140-writers-room-mystery-comics-vol-2-issue-476\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #140 - Writers' Room: Mystery Comics, Vol. 2, Issue...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>April will make a fool out of all of us!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:30:04 This episode is the first one we've ever recorded remotely! If you can tell right away, apologies for the drop in audio quality. We'd much rather record in person, but the health...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
