      "created_at": "2022-03-17T10:18:35.838Z",
      "cooked": "<p>With the Miss Information story, I think there was also the implication that people found out but the Heroes later did a double hoax trick so most of them think M.I. lied to them or that M.I. had been tricked by the heroes.<br>\nJust like earlier stories where they learned Wraith’s ID.<br>\nOr stories from “real” comics where people learned the truth and then the heroes trick them into thinking what they saw was an elaborate hoax</p>",
